column23:
There is fortunately no strong correlation between the number of soft drink machines and the duration of your project.<p>Or should I say unfortunately because if there were we could speed up projects by getting rid of all soft drink machines or buying a large number of them.<p>somebody has way too much time on their hands:<p><pre><code>  $("#submit").click(function () {
	$("#answer").hide();
	$("#loading").show();
	setTimeout("showAnswer()", 2500);
  });

  function showAnswer()
	{
		$("#loading").hide();
		$("#answer").show();
	}</code></pre>
